2d:T904,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I get from Makkah to Taif?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"By road, about 90 km — roughly ~1 hr 10 min up the Al Hada road or the gentler Al Sail road. A private car collects you from your Makkah hotel and drops you at your Taif address, with the fare agreed before booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How far is Taif from Jeddah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"About 170 km by road, roughly ~2 hr. From Jeddah Airport it is about 180 km. Non-Muslim passengers are driven on the road that bypasses Makkah."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a day trip to Taif from Makkah or Jeddah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Book a timed return, or a driver by the hour so the car waits at Al Hada, Al Shafa and the rose farms. The day is quoted as one fare before you travel."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which car is best for the Taif mountain road?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A sedan suits one to three people with normal luggage. Families usually choose a full-size SUV such as a GMC Yukon XL, and larger groups a Hyundai Staria or a Hiace. We confirm the vehicle against your passengers and bags."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this car rental at Taif airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We do not rent self-drive cars — every booking is a car with a professional driver. We meet you at arrivals at Taif Regional Airport (TIF) and drive you where you need to go."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can the driver stop at the Miqat on the way to Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, if you ask when you book. Qarn al-Manazil at As-Sail Al-Kabir is the Miqat on the Taif side; whether a stop applies to you is your own decision."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can my company or group be invoiced?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Email an RFQ for a written quote. Corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is transport in Taif available 24/7?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Pre-book early-morning and late-night trips so the car and driver are planned in advance. Free cancellation up to 24 hours before pickup."}}]}28:["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2d"}}]
